  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Grant for research on climate and environment to raise public awareness on research outcome</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To implement activities to raise public awareness on the outcome of the research, and uptake into policy. The partnership will also explore enabling events, such as Roadshow, and/or workshops to identify the challenge, enhance the capacity of young researchers to engage in the policy process and explore other opportunities, such as institutional-level collaboration between Centre of Excellence to ensure sustainability beyond the programme period.</narrative>
  </description>
